  "goodToKnow": "Die Kulisse is a backdrop or stage scenery: vor der Kulisse der Alpen (against the backdrop of the Alps). Hinter den Kulissen means behind the scenes, in theatre and politics. In sports reporting, die Kulisse is the crowd and atmosphere: eine tolle Kulisse von 80.000 Zuschauern. Something that's nur Kulisse is just a façade. It came from French coulisse, the sliding panels used as theatre scenery."
